<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Appreciation: finding the original value (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A {@asset@} is valued today at Ksh \( {@A0@} \). Its value has been appreciating at \( {@R0@}\% \) per annum for the last \( {@T0@} \) years.</p>
<p>What was its value \( {@T0@} \) years ago? Give your answer to the nearest shilling.</p>
<div>Original value \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</div>
<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Now the new value \( A \) is known and the original value \( P \) is unknown. Make \( P \) the subject of \( A = P\left(1 + \frac{R}{100}\right)^T \):</p>
\[ P = \frac{A}{\left(1 + \frac{R}{100}\right)^T} = \frac{ {@A0@} }{ ({@float(1 + R0/100)@})^{ {@T0@} } } = {@round(P0)@}. \]
<p>Check: the original value must be <em>smaller</em> than today's value, because the asset has gained value.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[asset : rand(["business premises in Mombasa", "plot of land in Kitengela", "dairy farm in Nyandarua", "rental house in Kakamega"]);
A0 : rand([2400000, 3600000, 4200000, 5000000, 6500000]);
R0 : rand([5, 6, 8, 10, 12]);
T0 : rand([3, 4, 5, 6]);
P0 : A0/(1 + R0/100)^T0;
w_mult : A0*(1 + R0/100)^T0;             /* grew it forward instead of back */
w_dep  : A0*(1 - R0/100)^T0;             /* reduced by R% per year */
w_simple : A0/(1 + R0*T0/100);           /* reversed simple growth */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
    <specificfeedback format="html">
      <text/>
    </specificfeedback>
    <questionnote format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text>A={@A0@}, R={@R0@}, T={@T0@}: P={@round(P0)@}</text>
    </questionnote>
    <questiondescription format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text/>
    </questiondescription>
    <questionsimplify>1</questionsimplify>
    <assumepositive>0</assumepositive>
    <assumereal>0</assumereal>
    <prtcorrect format="html">
      <text>Correct answer, well done.</text>
    </prtcorrect>
    <prtpartiallycorrect format="html">
      <text>Your answer is partially correct.</text>
    </prtpartiallycorrect>
    <prtincorrect format="html">
      <text>Incorrect answer.</text>
    </prtincorrect>
    <decimals>.</decimals>
    <scientificnotation>*10</scientificnotation>
    <multiplicationsign>dot</multiplicationsign>
    <sqrtsign>1</sqrtsign>
    <complexno>i</complexno>
    <inversetrig>cos-1</inversetrig>
    <logicsymbol>lang</logicsymbol>
    <matrixparens>[</matrixparens>
    <isbroken>0</isbroken>
    <variantsselectionseed/>
    <input>
      <name>ans1</name>
      <type>numerical</type>
      <tans>round(P0)</tans>
      <boxsize>12</boxsize>
      <strictsyntax>1</strictsyntax>
      <insertstars>0</insertstars>
      <syntaxhint/>
      <syntaxattribute>0</syntaxattribute>
      <forbidwords/>
      <allowwords/>
      <forbidfloat>0</forbidfloat>
      <requirelowestterms>0</requirelowestterms>
      <checkanswertype>0</checkanswertype>
      <mustverify>1</mustverify>
      <showvalidation>3</showvalidation>
      <options/>
    </input>
    <prt>
